<title>JAPAN: Juntendo to issue 5 bln convertible.</title>
<headline>Juntendo to issue 5 bln convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Juntendo Co</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - San-in Godo Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	  ISSUE NO   2	 AMT   5 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.4(tentatively) ISSU PRICE PAR     MATURITY 27.Feb.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE		 CONV FROM 1.Nov.96  CONV TO 26.Feb.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY		 PAY DATE 19.Sep.96  INT PAY end-Feb/Aug</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 12-18.Sep</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p> The coupon and conversion price will be decided on</p>
<p> September 11.</p>
</text>
